9
00:00:27,970 --> 00:00:29,290
The owner of a convenience store

10
00:00:29,290 --> 00:00:30,670
Called Lin Yu

11
00:00:30,670 --> 00:00:32,520
Convenience store owner

12
00:00:32,520 --> 00:00:35,640
My X car was repaired by him. Today I’m talking to Boss Jin

13
00:00:35,640 --> 00:00:36,720
negotiated cooperation

14
00:00:36,720 --> 00:00:38,200
Thanks to him for selling it
